OL,3,GNEWSADomestic abuser who threw axe at
OL,4,Apartner sentenced
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who strangled a woman, put a
OL,7,Fpillow over her face and repeatedly
OL,8,Fthreatened to harm members of her
OL,9,Ffamily over a 10-month period has been
OL,10,Fsentenced.
OL,12,FAlexander Kennedy subjected his then
OL,13,Fpartner to several assaults, including
OL,14,Fone with vodka bottle, between
OL,15,FSeptember 2023 and August 2024.
OL,17,FDouglas Courthouse heard on one
OL,18,Foccasion the 52-year-old had thrown an
OL,19,Faxe he kept next to a log burner in his
OL,20,Fliving room at the wall above her head.
